.TH CALAMANSID "1" "March 2026" "calamansid" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
calamansid \- Request router for Calamansi Juice Server LLM serving system
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B calamansid
[\fI\,OPTIONS\/\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
calamansid handles request routing and load balancing for the Calamansi
Juice Server LLM serving system. It distributes requests across available
LLM instances for optimal performance.
.SH OPTIONS
Run \fBcalamansid --help\fR for detailed usage information.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR calamansi (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Calamansi Juice 2 developers
.SH REPORTING BUGS
Report bugs at: https://github.com/rolandpascua-cloud/calamansi-juice-2/issues
